## Residual risk (accepted)

Queue drop of sample *k* can leave carry reflecting *k−1* while *k+1* is written with a skewed delta (first-writer-wins). Mitigate with large queue budget; sync_timedb still repairs missing *seconds* from disk but cannot overwrite live-written keys.

